 impacted by the continued paydowns we experienced and the government shutdown, trade tariff controversy and the seasonal economy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/25/prosperity-bancshares-inc-pb-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"PB 2019 Q1","e":"pb","d":"2019-04-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"David Zalman","x":"And when we did some restructuring for the customer recently, he pledged additional collateral, that being real estate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/25/prosperity-bancshares-inc-pb-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"PB 2019 Q1","e":"pb","d":"2019-04-24","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Peter Winter","x":"You reiterated the guidance for loan growth at 5%, and if I look at average loan growth, it moderated this quarter and the end of period.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/25/prosperity-bancshares-inc-pb-q1-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"PB 2019 Q3","e":"pb","d":"2019-10-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"H.E. Timanus","x":"You hear a lot of publicity about the tariffs and all that, and the government is covering a lot of these farmers with payments from the government in that regard.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/23/prosperity-bancshares-inc-pb-q3-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"PB 2019 Q4","e":"pb","d":"2020-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Asylbek Osmonov","x":"We expect to realize portion of the previously announced cost savings related to the Merger, beginning in the third quarter of 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/prosperity-bancshares-inc-pb-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"PB 2019 Q4","e":"pb","d":"2020-01-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Asylbek Osmonov","x":"But the majority of savings that we announced, about 25% cost savings would come into second half of the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/29/prosperity-bancshares-inc-pb-q4-2019-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"PB 2020 Q1","e":"pb","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Asylbek Osmonov","x":"As we discussed in prior quarters, we expect to realize most of our cost savings from the LegacyTexas merger beginning in the third quarter of 2020 after the system integration that is planned for June.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/prosperity-bancshares-inc-pb-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"PB 2020 Q1","e":"pb","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Asylbek Osmonov","x":"To date, we have already realized some cost savings from the merger and eventually expect additional cost savings of approximately $8 million to $9 million per quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/prosperity-bancshares-inc-pb-q1-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"PB 2020 Q2","e":"pb","d":"2020-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kevin Hanigan","x":"If we look at stressed areas, things that would be on your top of mind is probably hotels, although I don't think we have any of them pass-through at the moment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/prosperity-bancshares-inc-pb-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"PB 2020 Q2","e":"pb","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Asylbek Osmonov","x":"With the core system conversion and operational integration process behind us, we do not anticipate any significant merger related expenses going forward, and we expect to start realizing the remaining cost savings beginning in the third quarter of 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/prosperity-bancshares-inc-pb-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"PB 2020 Q2","e":"pb","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Asylbek Osmonov","x":"This, combined with the savings realized in the first and second quarter, will be in line with our previously stated 25% cost savings in non-interest expense.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/prosperity-bancshares-inc-pb-q2-2020-earnings-call.aspx"},{"c":"PB 2020 Q3","e":"pb","d":"2020-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Asylbek Osmonov","x":"The efficiency ratio was impacted by the merger cost savings and higher than anticipated loans fair value income during the third quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/prosperity-bancshares-inc-pb-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"PB 2020 Q3","e":"pb","d":"2020-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Asylbek Osmonov","x":"Yeah, I mean from the cost savings from the acquisition of, yeah, we realized, most of the cost spending, there might be small items we're looking at right now, but I have to say that while we may be have -- we will save a little bit more, but reinvesting in the technology, which is a one of that…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/28/prosperity-bancshares-inc-pb-q3-2020-earnings-call/"},{"c":"PB 2021 Q2","e":"pb","d":"2021-07-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"David E. Zalman","x":"I don't think it's just transitory as everybody said, in fact, all the price increases that people that were -- they're minimum wage and they've taken it up.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/prosperity-bancshares-inc-pb-q2-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"PB 2025 Q2","e":"pb","d":"2025-07-23","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Kevin Hanigan","x":"I think a lot of that was tariff-related.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/23/prosperity-pb-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"PB 2025 Q3","e":"pb","d":"2025-10-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"David Zalman","x":"Although the economy is showing some signs of moderation, influenced by factors such as tariffs and immigration policies, we believe Texas remains the best place for business with a pro-business attitude and no state income tax.","url"